description	"Admiral Dodonna 

Republic Tactician, commands large numbers of troops and droids.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Modified Service Pistol (3)
-- Mag Reload
-- Disruptify/Flame and Cripple On Hit
-- 5%+ Damage
-- 35% more FP Drain
-- 35% less RoF
-- 40% More Velocity
- Stun Baton (1)

^8Attributes:
- Republic Scanner (Tracking Beacon)
- 25% Faster Hacking
- Tactical Oversight (Stat Viewer)
- Rally
- Strong Minded (Anti Mind Trick 2)
- Reinforcement Coordination (On Round Start Summon Republic Soldier)
- Inspire (Force Team Energize 2)

^3Abilities:
- Command (Resource/Block Point Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- P-Shield (1) ^3[CS2]
- Rally The Republic (Summon Republic Trooper) ^3[CS3]
- Seeker Droid ^3[CS4]"